ze":81,"digest":"sha256:8c7419f96f402f219d5693f43870ce6165cd5f1cf6966534bfa615d08524a49f","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-11-20T02:11:19Z","updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:11:19Z"}],"body":"## Release Notes\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- *(ai)* Parse SKILL.md frontmatter with CRLF line endings ([#4758](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4758))\n- *(ai)* Resolve in-flight tools when the chat stream fails ([#4759](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4759))\n- *(ai)* Don't re-prompt the model after server-side tool calls ([#4310](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4310))\n- *(daemon)* Search index race conditions ([#4730](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4730))\n- *(mcp)* Keep the Atuin for Teams tool list cached from the daemon, and keep it through a failed call ([#4726](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4726))\n- *(mcp)* Tell Atuin for Teams which thread is calling, and load atuin_history up front ([#4768](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4768))\n- *(nushell)* Make keybindings work in helix mode ([#4738](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4738))\n- *(opencode)* Write handed-off tool calls as opencode 2's own shell, read, write and edit ([#4665](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4665))\n- *(pty-proxy)* Don't spawn pty when piped ([#4734](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4734))\n- *(pty-proxy)* Propagate outer terminal pixel size to inner PTY ([#4619](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4619))\n- *(setup)* Let enter expand/close submenus ([#4771](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4771))\n- *(setup)* Ignore comments in shell init files ([#4772](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4772))\n- *(threads)* Don't offer agents atuin can't write to as --in targets ([#4662](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4662))\n- *(threads)* Catch a Claude Code copy up past its own turn_duration line ([#4733](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4733))\n- *(threads)* Keep omp background job results and notices ([#4773](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4773))\n- *(userio)* Escape control characters in messages for the user ([#4757](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4757))\n- Standardize path to `atuin` in external config ([#4766](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4766))\n- Create the key file without a hard link on Android/Termux ([#4767](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4767))\n\n\n### Documentation\n\n- *(readme)* Rework the README around rendered demos\n- Adjust readme ([#4747](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4747))\n\n\n### Features\n\n- *(config)* Warn about and avoid setting unknown keys ([#4727](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4727))\n- *(setup)* Make atuin setup the way to set atuin up\n- *(setup)* Further atuin setup improvements\n- *(setup)* Individually select arrow and checkbox ([#4774](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4774))\n- *(threads)* Read content blocks of kinds a newer atuin added ([#4735](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4735))\n- Move datetime handling to jiff, with DST-aware time zones ([#4765](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4765))\n\n\n### Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- *(ai)* Remove the Atuin AI agent ([#4764](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4764))\n- *(theme)* Remove theme.max_depth and theme.debug ([#4755](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4755))\n- Update agent instructions ([#4754](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4754))\n- Move release skill to `.agents` ([#4775](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4775))\n\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(daemon)* Update the search index in place on delete ([#4743](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4743))\n\n\n### Refactor\n\n- Ensure ai features are gated by \"ai\" crate feature ([#4756](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/issues/4756))\n\n\n### Testing\n\n- *(common)* Keep repo walk proptest clear of Windows device names\n\n# atuin 18.25.0\n\n## Install atuin 18.25.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download atuin 18.25.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [atuin-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [atuin-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [atuin-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [atuin-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.msi](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.msi) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.msi.sha256) |\n| [atuin-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [atuin-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [atuin-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | ARM64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [atuin-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n\n## Verifying GitHub Artifact Attestations\n\nThe artifacts in this release have attestations generated with GitHub Artifact Attestations. These can be verified by using the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/manual/gh_attestation_verify):\n```sh\ngh attestation verify <file-path of downloaded artifact> --repo atuinsh/atuin\n```\n\nYou can also download the attestation from [GitHub](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/attestations) and verify against that directly:\n```sh\ngh attestation verify <file-path of downloaded artifact> --bundle <file-path of downloaded attestation>\n```\n\n# atuin-server 18.25.0\n\n## Install atuin-server 18.25.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-server-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-server-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download atuin-server 18.25.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [atuin-server-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atuin-server-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/atuinsh/atuin/releases/download/v18.25.0/atui